Given the following premises and a conclusion, determine whether the conclusion logically follows from the premises.

Premises:
- forall x (Student(x) AND WorkIn(x, library) -> (NOT From(x, computerScienceDepartment)))
- forall x (Student(x) AND Have(x, partTimeJob) AND OfferedBy(y, university) -> WorkIn(x, library))
- forall x ((Student(x) AND Take(x, databaseCourse)) -> From(x, computerScienceDepartment))
- forall x ((Student(x) AND InstructedBy(x, professorDavid)) -> Take(x, databaseCourse))
- forall x ((Student(x) AND WorkIn(x, lab)) -> InstructedBy(x, professorDavid))
- Student(james) AND WorkIn(james, lab)
- NOT exists x (PartTimeJob(x) AND Have(james, x) AND OfferedBy(x, computerScienceDepartment)) AND NOT WorkIn(james, lab)

